        "GNT-ASYNC-START-001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-08",
      "status": "resolved",
      "resolution": "An adapter-owned Tokio runtime helper is conforming only when construction, ownership, and shutdown are explicit; interpreter operations never create a hidden runtime.",
      "normative_requirements": [
        "GNT-3.3-runtime-ownership"
